## Exact Visual Differences
1. **Left Panel Text:** Current has "Dinas Perhubungan \n Kota Surabaya" text; Reference does not.
2. **Left Panel Overlay:** Reference has a darker, more pronounced blue overlay.
3. **Email Input Icon:** Current has envelope icon; Reference has no icon.
4. **Email Input Placeholder:** Current is "nama@email.com"; Reference is "Masukkan email Anda".
5. **Password Input Icon:** Current has lock icon on the left; Reference has no lock icon on the left.
6. **Password Input Placeholder:** Current is "Masukkan kata sandi"; Reference is "Masukkan kata sandi Anda".
7. **Lupa Kata Sandi Text:** Reference seems to have a typo "Lupa Kota Sandi?" whereas current is "Lupa Kata Sandi?".

